# Shadow test rig - a broad solid occluder over a receiving plane.
# Deliberately NOT a small centred box: see goldenRenderSuite.cpp. The
# occluder spans the plane so its shadow covers a large area regardless of
# window size or how much of the viewport the GUI overlay covers.
# Ground: 60x60 at y=0. Slab: 44 x 2 x 12, centred at (0, 9, -4).

